<title>USA: Viacom companies join for action movie.</title>
<headline>Viacom companies join for action movie.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nickelodeon on Monday unveiled it Worldwide Development Group and said the new unit has joined with fellow Viacom firm Showtime Network Inc for the action movie &quot;Doom Runners.&quot;</p>
<p>Nickelodeon Worldwide will produce the film starting in early 1997. The movie is slated to premier on Showtime in the US and will also air on Nickelodeon in the US and Australia.</p>
<p>The company said the purpose of the new unit is to draw on talent from around the world to produce new shows and made-for-television movies.</p>
</text>
